= The Infrastructure Bill

A bipartisan infrastructure bill awaits a vote, while a much bigger social-spending package is stalled by moderate senators. Progressives want to hold the first hostage to the second.

- @infra_pass: Pass infrastructure now
- @infra_hostage: Hold it until the bigger bill passes

@infra_pass
on-arrival: budget -= 1; economic_growth += 0.4; abundance_strength += 2; gopmod_relation += 4; progressive_dissent += 5; working_dem += 2*(1-dissent); institutions += 1

The bipartisan bill becomes law; roads, bridges, and broadband get funded.

@infra_hostage
on-arrival: progressive_dissent -= 4; moderate_dissent += 6; gopmod_relation -= 4; working_dem -= 1*(1-dissent); polarization += 1; budget -= 0

Weeks of brinkmanship follow; both bills end up in trouble.
